{"id":"481767","name":"石斛花胶海参汤","author":"elmonte","authorId":"266491","desc":"","cover":"images/481767/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"花胶","amount":"150g"},{"name":"小海参","amount":"7-8条"},{"name":"石斛","amount":"1把"},{"name":"瘦肉","amount":"300g"},{"name":"小干贝","amount":"1把"}],"sub":[{"name":"红枣","amount":"10颗"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"泡发好的海参花胶飞水去腥。","img":"images/481767/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"花胶切小片。","img":"images/481767/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"瘦肉飞水，洗净浮沫。","img":"images/481767/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"石斛洗一下，用刀背或锤子把石斛拍扁，这样容易出味。","img":"images/481767/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"红枣去核","img":"images/481767/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"小干贝洗一下。","img":"images/481767/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"把以上所有材料放入电压力锅，按炖汤功能键，开煮。","img":"images/481767/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"煲好排气后就可以打开盖子，小干贝带咸味，盐酌情放。","img":"images/481767/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"鲜香美味，满满的胶原蛋白。","img":"images/481767/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"来一碗吧。","img":"images/481767/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}